              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 12:1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwalenga ikumi limo na bune (14) ubwa mu mweshi wapakubala, abafumine muli bunkole ku Babiloni basefya Ipasaka inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lipasaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishiwi lya Cihibulu ilyalola mukutila “ukucilila,” moneni Ukufuma 12:13 na 27.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashimapepo bonse na bena Levi bonse baisangulula no kubafye abakaele bonse. Baipaya abana ba mpaanga be lambo lye Pasaka ilyakupapatilako abantu bonse ababwelele ukufuma muli bunkole, no kupapatilako bashimapepo banabo pamo pene na bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli bonse abafumine muli bunkole balile umwana wa mpaanga pamo pene na bantufye bonse abaipatwile kukukanakonka intambi ishikowesha isha bantu ba mu calo pakuti bambe ukupepa Yawe Lesa wa bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basefeshe ne nsansa inshikunkulu ya Mukate uushatutumuka pa nshiku cine lubali, pantu Yawe alibasansamwishe no kulenga ukuti umutima wa mfumu ya ku Asiria upilibuke pakuti ibafweko mu mulimo wakukuula iŋanda yakwa Lesa, Lesa wa bena Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
